#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/flac.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of FLAC"
msgstr "Instalação do FLAC"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/flac.xml:99
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>FLAC</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>FLAC</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/flac.xml:103
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                                \\\n"
"            --disable-thorough-tests                     \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/flac-&flac-version;          &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                                \\\n"
"            --disable-thorough-tests                     \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/flac-&flac-version;          &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/flac.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>. Note that if you "
"passed the <option>--enable-exhaustive-tests</option> and <option>--enable-"
"valgrind-testing</option> parameters to <command>configure</command> and "
"then run the test suite, it will take a <emphasis>very</emphasis> long time "
"(up to 300 SBUs) and use about 375 MB of disk space."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>. Observe "
"que, se você passou nos parâmetros <option>--enable-exhaustive-"
"tests</option> e <option>--enable-valgrind-testing</option> para o "
"<command>configure</command> e depois executar a suíte de teste, levará "
"tempo <emphasis>muito</emphasis> longo(até 300 UPCs) e usará cerca de 375 MB"
" de espaço em disco."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/flac.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/flac.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/flac.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/flac.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-thorough-tests</parameter>: This parameter is used so "
"that the test suite will complete in a reasonable amount of time.  Remove it"
" if you desire more extensive tests."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-thorough-tests</parameter>: Esse parâmetro é usado de "
"forma que a suíte de teste completará em um período de tempo razoável. "
"Remova-o se você desejar testes mais extensos."

